       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-IDEMPOTENT-TOTIENT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-IDEMPOTENT-TOTIENT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-IDEMPOTENT-NULL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-PRESERVE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FAULT-ISOLATION-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NULL-LATENCY-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-IDEMPOTENT-SEAL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-IDEMPOTENT-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-NULL-PROVEN          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-NULL-CODE          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-IDEMPOTENT-AND-TOTIENT.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ISOLATION-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-NULL-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-IDEMPOTENT-AND-TOTIENT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-IDEMPOTENT-NULL-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-PRESERVE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ISOLATION-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FAULT-ISOLATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NULL-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-NULL-PROOFS.
           IF WS-IDEMPOTENT-NULL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TOTIENT-PRESERVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FAULT-ISOLATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-NULL-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-IDEMPOTENT-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-NULL-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-NULL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-NULL-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-NULL-CODE.
